[
  {
    "text": "Every eruption in Alaska signs",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.45,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "its name in ash.",
    "start": 2.48,
    "end": 3.76,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "The trick is reading the signature.",
    "start": 4.3,
    "end": 6.32,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "On land the layers stack like",
    "start": 7.12,
    "end": 8.99,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "pages, then glaciers scrape the",
    "start": 9.02,
    "end": 11.63,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "page blank.",
    "start": 11.66,
    "end": 12.36,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "So three federal scientists in",
    "start": 13.1,
    "end": 15.030000000000001,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "Anchorage went looking for a copy.",
    "start": 15.06,
    "end": 16.84,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "They found one under the Gulf",
    "start": 17.52,
    "end": 19.169999999999998,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "of Alaska, in long tubes of",
    "start": 19.2,
    "end": 21.65,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "mud punched from the seafloor.",
    "start": 21.68,
    "end": 23.32,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "Seventy ash layers out of eight",
    "start": 24.1,
    "end": 26.049999999999997,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "tubes, a record they call virtually",
    "start": 26.08,
    "end": 29.214,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "uninterrupted, reaching into the",
    "start": 29.244,
    "end": 30.39,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "ice ages.",
    "start": 30.42,
    "end": 31.709999999999997,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "They sorted them into thirty seven",
    "start": 31.74,
    "end": 33.73,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "eruptions, then asked which volcano",
    "start": 33.76,
    "end": 36.129999999999995,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "threw each.",
    "start": 36.16,
    "end": 37.12,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "The answer doesn't always come",
    "start": 38.78,
    "end": 41.29,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "back with one name.",
    "start": 41.32,
    "end": 42.02,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "Ash carries trace elements, a chemical",
    "start": 42.38,
    "end": 44.87,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "handwriting.",
    "start": 44.9,
    "end": 45.66,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "A machine learning model reads",
    "start": 46.54,
    "end": 48.23,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "it and names the most probable",
    "start": 48.26,
    "end": 49.949999999999996,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "source, or sources.",
    "start": 49.98,
    "end": 51.46,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "It's confident about Katmai, Fisher",
    "start": 52.6,
    "end": 54.61,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "Caldera and Emmons Lake, because",
    "start": 54.64,
    "end": 56.79,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "each keeps writing the same ratios,",
    "start": 56.82,
    "end": 58.88,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "eruption after eruption.",
    "start": 59.36,
    "end": 60.9,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "That repetition is what separates",
    "start": 63.28,
    "end": 64.81,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "one volcano from another.",
    "start": 64.84,
    "end": 66.3,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "The model reads a difference the",
    "start": 66.82,
    "end": 68.57,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "rock already made.",
    "start": 68.6,
    "end": 69.86,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "And when the model isn't the",
    "start": 70.68,
    "end": 72.25,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "right tool, they don't force it.",
    "start": 72.28,
    "end": 73.86,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "They measure chemical distance.",
    "start": 74.38,
    "end": 75.68,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "None of this forecasts an eruption.",
    "start": 76.9,
    "end": 79.1,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "Chemistry has traced ash for decades.",
    "start": 79.7,
    "end": 81.56,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "What's new is how carefully they",
    "start": 82.46,
    "end": 84.21,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "said which volcanoes they could",
    "start": 84.24,
    "end": 85.69,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "name, and which they couldn't.",
    "start": 85.72,
    "end": 87.38,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "Alaska's record didn't disappear.",
    "start": 88.42,
    "end": 90.1,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "It settled where nobody was reading.",
    "start": 90.78,
    "end": 92.44,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "What else is down there, with",
    "start": 93.34,
    "end": 95.13,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "a name still on it?",
    "start": 95.16,
    "end": 96.2,
    "seg": 15
  }
]